    "display_name": "Large-Animal Veterinarian",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Amara travels to farms to track the health of entire herds",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://images.code.org/a7bcf0674c174889902cedf21e0e9dcf-amara.jpg",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
    "panels": [
      {
        "text": "**Job**: Large-animal veterinarian who travels to farms and herding families\n\n**Purpose**: Tracking the health of hundreds of animals across dozens of farms. Sensor collars record each animal's temperature, movement, and location, and Amara needs a clinic computer that reads that data, flags animals that may be getting sick, and stores years of records.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/c1d51c107ba41ae4883213cd586788d2-amara-pane-1.jpg",
        "key": "undefined-42e502a3-e175-46f1-b693-dc6455a6cdd6"
      },
      {
        "text": "**Budget**: $900\n\nCovers the entire system, including the operating system and peripherals",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/0600f566250eb6816897c67e3f2d5951-amara-pane-2.jpg",
        "key": "undefined-ff576ae3-1788-4ada-b264-7238ac25cc64"
      },
      {
        "text": "**Important Info**: Power in Amara's area goes out several times a week, and the clinic gets dusty. The computer has to keep working through both.\n\n**Preferences**:\n\n* Low power use, so a battery backup can keep it running during an outage\n* Solid state storage only, since there are no moving parts to damage\n* A case with dust filters she can remove and clean herself",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/d10799242b4f21c7563269f78c1ae62d-amara-pane-3.jpg",
        "key": "undefined-035ce7ea-43d7-45a0-8f29-87a9fa949a04",
        "layout": "text-top-left"
      }
    ],
    "use_links": "false"
  },
